---
import Page from "../components/Page.astro";
import Badge from "../components/Badge.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Page
	title="about — rights.wtf"
	description="Who makes rights.wtf, why it exists, and how we decide what goes on a country page."
	width="6xl"
>
	<a href="/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent hover:underline">&larr; home</a>

	<h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">about</h1>
	<p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
		rights.wtf is a small, independent project that turns legal text into something a tired person
		can actually read at 2am.
	</p>

	<div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold">
		<Badge tone="accent" size="md">independent</Badge>
		<Badge tone="warn" size="md">not legal advice</Badge>
		<Badge tone="info" size="md">open source</Badge>
	</div>

	<section class="mt-10 max-w-2xl" aria-labelledby="who-heading">
		<h2 id="who-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">who are we?</h2>
		<p class="mt-2 rounded-xl border border-line/60 bg-accent-soft/50 p-4 font-serif text-base italic text-ink">
			"nobody, really. two students."
		</p>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
			no but we really want to help queer people. this started as a silly little site project because
			reading 90-page legal gazettes when you are overwhelmed is the worst.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-10 max-w-2xl" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
		<h2 id="why-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">why this exists</h2>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
			most legal information online is written for lawyers, buried in PDFs, or out of date. for
			someone trying to figure out whether it is safe to be themselves, that is not good enough.
			we write the short version, link the source, and say plainly when we do not know something.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-10 max-w-2xl" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
		<h2 id="method-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">our method</h2>
		<ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
			<li>
				<strong class="font-bold text-ink">sources first.</strong> every claim should point at a
				statute, court decision, decree, or credible monitor.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong class="font-bold text-ink">label uncertainty.</strong> "not verified yet" is a real
				answer. we would rather leave a gap than invent one.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong class="font-bold text-ink">plain language.</strong> no jargon without a translation,
				no walls of text, no doom-scrolling required.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong class="font-bold text-ink">corrections welcome.</strong> if you know the law better
				than we do, tell us and we will fix it.
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-10 max-w-2xl" aria-labelledby="not-heading">
		<h2 id="not-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">what this is not</h2>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
			this is not legal advice, not medical advice, and not a substitute for a local advocate who
			knows your situation. laws change and enforcement varies. please verify anything important
			before acting on it.
		</p>
		<Badge tone="accent" border={false} size="md" class="mt-3">
			(not pro health info)
		</Badge>
	</section>

	<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-line bg-accent-soft/40 px-4 py-3 text-xs">
		<span class="text-ink-muted">want to help make this better?</span>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
			<Button href="/contribute" variant="primary" size="sm" shape="pill">
				contribute &rarr;
			</Button>
			<Button
				href="https://github.com/lonersoft/rights.wtf"
				variant="outline"
				size="sm"
				shape="pill"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
			>
				source code &rarr;
			</Button>
		</div>
	</div>

	<Footer slot="footer" />
</Page>
